<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5320644&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607609069" alt="Drstevensliu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5320644)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;">Drstevensliu</a></span></p>
